WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.268 --> 00:00:07.040 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(musique militaire)

00:00:04.638 --> 00:00:08.308 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Toujours deux pas derrière.

00:00:05.873 --> 00:00:09.576 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il aura passé la majorité de sa

00:00:07.141 --> 00:00:10.844 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vie dans l'ombre de la reine

00:00:08.409 --> 00:00:12.112 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Elizabeth II.

00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:13.380 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Homme dur selon certains,

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:14.615 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cocasse pour d'autres, le prince

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:15.849 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Philippe était peut-être

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:19.687 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'un des personnages

00:00:14.715 --> 00:00:20.888 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les plus difficiles à cerner

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:22.089 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Buckingham Palace.

00:00:19.787 --> 00:00:23.324 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Né prince de Grèce et du

00:00:20.988 --> 00:00:24.525 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Danemark en 1921, il quitte

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:27.561 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'île de Corfou en catastrophe

00:00:23.424 --> 00:00:28.762 size:53% position:73% line:53%
alors qu'il n'a

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:29.997 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'un an et demi.

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.198 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 La monarchie grecque vient

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:32.433 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de tomber. Sa famille se réfugie

00:00:30.097 --> 00:00:33.667 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en France.

00:00:31.298 --> 00:00:34.868 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Sa mère souffre de

00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:36.103 size:53% position:73% line:53%
schizophrènie, son père part

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:37.538 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vivre à Monaco, le jeune prince

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:38.739 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se destine à une carrière

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:39.940 size:53% position:73% line:53%
militaire.

00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:41.175 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Il devient aussi un athlète

00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:42.409 size:53% position:73% line:53%
accompli.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.610 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 À 18 ans, il s'engage dans la

00:00:41.275 --> 00:00:48.182 size:53% position:73% line:53%
marine anglaise et rencontre

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:49.383 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour la première fois Elizabeth

00:00:43.711 --> 00:00:50.617 size:53% position:73% line:53%
venue visiter le collège naval.

00:00:48.282 --> 00:00:52.486 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 La jeune princesse n'a alors

00:00:49.483 --> 00:00:53.687 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que 13 ans : c'est le coup

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:54.888 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de foudre.

00:00:52.586 --> 00:00:56.123 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le couple entretient une

00:00:53.787 --> 00:01:00.961 size:53% position:73% line:53%
correspondance, jusqu'à la

00:00:54.955 --> 00:01:02.162 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Seconde Guerre mondiale.

00:00:56.223 --> 00:01:03.364 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(explosion)

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:04.598 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Philippe combat pendant six ans

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:05.799 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur les eaux d'Europe et d'Asie.

00:01:03.497 --> 00:01:07.034 size:53% position:73% line:53%
À son retour, en 1946, le jeune

00:01:04.698 --> 00:01:10.170 size:53% position:73% line:53%
prince est premier lieutenant

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:11.372 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'un destroyer et n'a pas oublié

00:01:07.134 --> 00:01:12.606 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Elizabeth.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.807 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pendant des mois, ils se

00:01:11.472 --> 00:01:15.042 size:53% position:73% line:53%
fréquentent, mais le mariage

00:01:12.706 --> 00:01:16.276 size:53% position:73% line:53%
semble impossible.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:17.478 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Philippe n'a plus de trône et

00:01:15.142 --> 00:01:18.712 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'entourage de la princesse

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:19.947 size:53% position:73% line:53%
craint que le jeune homme au

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:21.148 size:53% position:73% line:53%
franc parler ne respecte pas le

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:22.382 size:53% position:73% line:53%
protocole.

00:01:20.047 --> 00:01:23.584 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le public, séduit,

00:01:21.248 --> 00:01:24.818 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en décidera autrement.

00:01:22.483 --> 00:01:26.019 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 En novembre 1947, leur rêve

00:01:23.684 --> 00:01:29.723 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se réalise. Un an plus tard,

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:30.958 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Charles voit le jour. Mais leur

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:32.192 size:53% position:73% line:53%
bonheur est de courte durée.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:39.299 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le roi George VI meurt.

00:01:31.058 --> 00:01:39.299 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Elizabeth accède au trône,

00:01:32.326 --> 00:01:39.299 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à seulement 27 ans.

00:01:42.069 --> 00:01:45.639 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pour Philippe, ce couronnement

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:46.840 size:53% position:73% line:53%
signifie la fin de sa carrière

00:01:44.505 --> 00:01:51.178 size:53% position:73% line:53%
militaire et, contrairement

00:01:45.739 --> 00:01:52.379 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aux femmes de souverain,

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:53.614 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il ne pourra jamais devenir roi.

00:01:51.278 --> 00:01:54.848 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le prince devra se contenter

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:56.049 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'un rôle secondaire et surtout

00:01:53.714 --> 00:01:57.284 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'être le plus discret possible.

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:58.485 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Il portera le titre de prince

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:59.720 size:53% position:73% line:53%
consort. Avec ses nombreuses

00:01:57.384 --> 00:02:00.921 size:53% position:73% line:53%
gaffes et faux pas,

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:05.959 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le prince s'amuse des Anglais.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:07.160 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais certains diront qu'il avait

00:02:01.021 --> 00:02:08.362 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un charme indéniable.

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:09.596 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 D'ailleurs, les journaux à

00:02:07.261 --> 00:02:10.798 size:53% position:73% line:53%
potins vont rapporter plusieurs

00:02:08.462 --> 00:02:12.032 size:53% position:73% line:53%
frasques amoureuses

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:14.268 size:53% position:73% line:53%
hors mariage.

00:02:10.931 --> 00:02:15.502 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ (trompette) ♪

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:16.737 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Mais pour beaucoup, le prince

00:02:14.368 --> 00:02:17.938 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Philippe était un homme

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:21.675 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de principe qui croyait en la

00:02:16.837 --> 00:02:22.876 size:53% position:73% line:53%
famille, qui a fini par avoir

00:02:18.038 --> 00:02:24.111 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le respect des Britanniques.

00:02:21.775 --> 00:02:25.312 size:53% position:73% line:53%
En mai 2017, à 95 ans il s'est

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:26.547 size:53% position:73% line:53%
retiré de la vie publique.

00:02:24.211 --> 00:02:27.748 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il était le soutien indéfectible

00:02:25.412 --> 00:02:28.181 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la reine.

00:02:26.647 --> 00:02:28.181 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Azeb Wolde-Giorghis,

00:02:27.848 --> 00:02:28.181 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, Montréa

